 "text": "Hey, good to hear from you. How are you? Totally normal feeling. Pick a quiet spot at the table, order something you really like and act as if you've been there for years. People usually leave you alone. Hmm, either way you feel is fine. Some people read, some people chat with the waitstaff. Do what feels right. Lovely. Go during the quieter time, like weekday and share a plate together. You' each order something to eat, and it' be much cheaper than going alone. Sensible. Lingering eateries are the way to go if you want to spend more time with someone.",
